window.SEARCH_INDEX=[{"t":"Welcome to Fomo Leads: How It Works","d":"A quick overview of how Fomo Leads gets exclusive leads to you.","c":"Getting Started","u":"articles/welcome-to-fomo-leads.html","x":"Welcome to Fomo Leads ! We're a done-for-you lead service for insurance agents. You don't build campaigns, manage an ad account or set ad budgets. We do that part. How it works 1. Pick a plan and add funds. 2. We run Meta ads in your states. 3. Leads land in your member area and CRM , billed at your locked rate. What leads are available? Mortgage Protection leads are live. Your per-lead rate is shown on the Wallet page ($21.63 as of October 2026) and is locked each time you add funds. Final Expense , General Term and IUL are coming soon, and you can join the waitlist for each one. See Lead categories and the waitlist . Every lead is yours \"Real-time, fresh, exclusive leads — yours for life, never resold.\" Every lead is OTP-verified , which means they confirmed their phone number with a one-time code. Need help? Email support@fomoleads.io ."},{"t":"I Just Signed Up. How Do I Start?","d":"Your first-day checklist, from agreement to first lead.","c":"Getting Started","u":"articles/i-just-signed-up-how-do-i-start.html","x":"Here's everything to do on day one, in order. 1. Accept the Client Lead Agreement on the welcome screen. Type your full name, tick both boxes and click Agree and continue . This step doesn't charge your payment method. 2. Choose a trial or plan at https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet. Click Start my trial for $247 , or pick Launch , Grow or Scale . 3. Add funds at https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet. Funding unlocks once you've picked a trial or plan. 4. Choose your states at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings under Coverage states , then click Save states . This is required before any new leads can come to you. 5. Set your daily leads at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings, then click Save daily leads . 6. Set up your thank-you page profile at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. Add your photo, the number your leads text, and your contact card. 7. Allow lead alerts in your browser so you're notified when a lead is assigned to you. 8. (Optional) Connect your CRM at https://members.fomoleads.io/integrations, or add reps at https://members.fomoleads.io/team. Your dashboard at https://members.fomoleads.io/dashboard shows a Finish account setup checklist so you can see what's le"},{"t":"Your Dashboard: Setup Checklist and Stats","d":"What every card on your dashboard means.","c":"Getting Started","u":"articles/your-dashboard-setup-checklist-and-stats.html","x":"Your dashboard lives at https://members.fomoleads.io/dashboard. Finish account setup Until setup is complete, you'll see a checklist: - Choose states: \"Required before any new leads can route to you.\" - Add funds: \"Your wallet balance determines how many leads you can receive.\" Your stats Card What it shows --- --- Wallet balance Funds available for leads Leads received Leads delivered to you Active states States you're covering Est. leads remaining Roughly how many leads your balance covers Leads worked, Contact rate, Booking rate How you're working your leads Closer stats Your dashboard also tracks AP Closed , Commission , Average AP , Profit , CAC , ROI , AP ROAS and Lead to Close . Use the I closed a deal button to record a sale (see Tracking closes and ROI ). \"You're out of leads\" If your wallet is empty, you'll see: \"You're out of leads. Your wallet is empty, so no new leads are being sent to you right now.\" Click Add funds to resume delivery ."},{"t":"Accepting the Client Lead Agreement","d":"What the agreement covers, and why accepting it doesn't charge you.","c":"Getting Started","u":"articles/accepting-the-client-lead-agreement.html","x":"After you sign up, you'll be asked to accept the FOMO Leads Client Lead Agreement . This is the agreement between you and FOMO Leads LLC . How to accept it 1. Type your full name . 2. Tick \"I have read and agree...\" . 3. Tick \"I am authorized to accept this agreement for this account and business.\" 4. Click Agree and continue . \"This step does not charge your payment method. You'll choose your package and funding separately.\" You'll then land on your wallet page. Key terms in plain English - Your membership renews every 30 days . - Membership fees don't become wallet funds. Leads are paid from your wallet separately. - Wallet loads are prepaid tranches, used oldest first . - Leads are exclusive to you for 30 days under the agreement. - There are no quality refunds or replacements on OTP-verified leads . Other refund requests are reviewed case by case through support@fomoleads.io. - Payments are processed by Whop . - You can cancel future renewals with Manage or cancel billing . Cancellation takes effect at the end of your paid period . Finding your copy later At https://members.fomoleads.io/settings, the Lead agreement section shows your version and who accepted it on which date. I"},{"t":"Setting a Password vs. Using an Email Sign-In Link","d":"Two ways to sign in to your Fomo Leads dashboard.","c":"Getting Started","u":"articles/setting-a-password-vs-email-sign-in-link.html","x":"You don't create a password at signup. Signup only asks for your full name, email and phone . After that you can sign in either way. Option 1: Email sign-in link 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/login. 2. Enter your email and click Email me a sign-in link . 3. Open the email and click the link. Option 2: Set a password 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/settings and find Password : \"Set a password to sign in without an email link.\" 2. Enter your New password and Confirm password . 3. Click Set password . Can't find the sign-in email? Check your spam or promotions folder, or email support@fomoleads.io ."},{"t":"How the $247 Trial Works","d":"Try Fomo Leads once, with no subscription.","c":"Billing & Wallet","u":"articles/how-the-247-trial-works.html","x":"Try Fomo for $247. \"Pay $247 once, then load up to $1,000 in ad spend and get leads in your states. No subscription.\" How to start 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet. 2. Click Start my trial for $247 . Payments are processed by Whop . 3. Add funds to your wallet. Wallet funds are separate from the $247. 4. Choose your states at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. Good to know - No recurring charge. The trial doesn't renew. - The $247 doesn't become wallet funds . Your leads are paid from what you load into your wallet, at the Mortgage Protection rate shown on your Wallet page ($21.63 per lead as of October 2026), locked when you add funds. - The trial covers up to $1,000 in ad spend . For more, pick a plan (see Plans and ad-spend caps )."},{"t":"Plans and Ad-Spend Caps","d":"Compare the trial and the Launch, Grow and Scale plans.","c":"Billing & Wallet","u":"articles/plans-and-ad-spend-caps.html","x":"\"Choose a plan to unlock funding. Leads are paid from your wallet.\" Plan Price Ad spend per period Best for --- --- --- --- Trial $247 once Up to $1,000 Trying Fomo, no subscription Launch $597 / 30 days Up to $3,000 One agent getting started Grow (Recommended) $997 / 30 days Up to $6,000 Steady daily flow for a full-time producer Scale $1,497 / 30 days Up to $10,000 Teams and top producers How caps work - Ad-spend caps reset every billing period. - Lead volume depends on your states and how the campaigns perform. - Leads are paid from your wallet at your locked rate . - Unused wallet funds stay in your wallet. Manage your plan at https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet?billing=manage ( Manage or cancel billing )."},{"t":"Adding Funds to Your Wallet and Locked Lead Rates","d":"How your prepaid wallet pays for leads, and how your rate is locked.","c":"Billing & Wallet","u":"articles/adding-funds-and-locked-lead-rates.html","x":"Every lead is paid for from your prepaid wallet . Adding funds 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet. Adding funds unlocks once you've chosen a trial or plan. 2. Enter an amount between $500 and $10,000 , or click Max . 3. The page shows how many leads that buys at your current rate. For example, at a rate of $21.63, $1,500 is about 69 Mortgage Protection leads . 4. Complete checkout. Payments are processed by Whop . Locked lead rates Lead category Price per lead --- --- Mortgage Protection Shown on your Wallet page ($21.63 as of October 2026), \"Locked for the funds you add today.\" Final Expense, General Term, IUL Coming soon The rate can change over time, so always check Your Mortgage Protection rate on the Wallet page. Your rate locks each time you add funds . Each load is a prepaid tranche, and tranches are used oldest first . So leads always come out of your earliest funds, at the rate locked for those funds. When your wallet is empty Delivery stops automatically. Your dashboard shows: \"You're out of leads. Your wallet is empty, so no new leads are being sent to you right now.\" Click Add funds to resume delivery . Tip: Keep an eye on Est. leads remaining on your dashboar"},{"t":"How Do I Cancel or Manage My Billing?","d":"Cancel future renewals or update billing.","c":"Billing & Wallet","u":"articles/how-do-i-cancel-or-manage-billing.html","x":"1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet?billing=manage. You can also click Manage or cancel billing in the Lead agreement section of https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. 2. Manage your plan or cancel future renewals there. Payments are processed by Whop . Good to know - Plans renew every 30 days . - Cancelling stops future renewals. It takes effect at the end of your paid period . - Unused wallet funds stay in your wallet. - Membership fees don't become wallet funds. Questions? Email support@fomoleads.io ."},{"t":"Choosing Your States","d":"Tell us where you're licensed so you only get leads there.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/choosing-your-states.html","x":"Choosing states is required before any new leads can route to you . 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/settings and find Coverage states . 2. Select your licensed states. You can pick from all 50 states plus DC. All and Clear help you select quickly. 3. Click Save states . There's nothing to relaunch, because we run the ads for you. See how each state is doing: https://members.fomoleads.io/states shows a per-state performance table (see Viewing state performance )."},{"t":"Viewing State Performance","d":"See which of your states are delivering and converting.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/viewing-state-performance.html","x":"https://members.fomoleads.io/states shows a performance table for each state . - Switch between the Dispositioned and All leads tabs. - Use search to find a state, and the volume filter to focus on busier states. To change which states you cover, go to Coverage states in https://members.fomoleads.io/settings."},{"t":"Setting Your Daily Leads and the Busy-Day +10","d":"Control how many leads you get each day.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/setting-daily-leads-and-the-busy-day-plus-10.html","x":"1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. 2. Move the Daily leads slider. The default is 15 . 3. Click Save daily leads . You'll see your cap, for example: \"Your cap today: 15, +10 on a busy day.\" What's the busy-day +10? \"On a busy day, when nobody else covering your states has room, we may send you up to 10 more verified leads, charged at your normal price.\" Things that affect your daily volume - Your wallet balance . Delivery stops at $0. - Your plan's ad-spend cap . - Your coverage states and how the campaigns perform."},{"t":"Where Can I See My Leads?","d":"Find every lead and its stats in one place.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/where-can-i-see-all-lead-details.html","x":"All your leads are at https://members.fomoleads.io/leads. - Use the All time filter to change the date range. - The stat cards show your balance, est. leads, leads, AP closed, cost per lead, contacts, contact rate, closes, closing rate and CAC. - Move each lead through its outcome stages: contacted , booked , no-show , presented , closed or archived . - Click Export CSV to download your leads (see Exporting leads to CSV )."},{"t":"Tracking Closes and ROI","d":"Record your sales and see your real return.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/tracking-closes-and-roi.html","x":"1. Click I closed a deal on https://members.fomoleads.io/dashboard. You can also mark a lead closed in https://members.fomoleads.io/leads. 2. Your dashboard updates your closer stats: AP Closed , Commission , Average AP , Profit , CAC , ROI , AP ROAS and Lead to Close . Using GoHighLevel? Your pipeline stages and AP can sync back automatically. See GoHighLevel disposition sync ."},{"t":"Exporting Leads to CSV","d":"Download your leads as a spreadsheet.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/exporting-leads-to-csv.html","x":"1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/leads. 2. Set the date filter (for example All time ). 3. Click Export CSV . 4. Open the file in Excel, Google Sheets or your CRM's import tool."},{"t":"Lead Exclusivity, OTP Verification and Refunds","d":"What makes a Fomo Leads lead, and how refunds work.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/lead-exclusivity-otp-and-refunds.html","x":"Exclusive \"Every lead is yours. Real-time, fresh, exclusive leads — yours for life, never resold.\" The Client Lead Agreement guarantees 30-day lead exclusivity . OTP-verified Every lead confirmed their phone number with a one-time code before submitting. Refunds - No quality refunds or replacements are given on OTP-verified leads. - Other refund requests are reviewed case by case . Email support@fomoleads.io with the lead's name and the date it arrived. - Unused wallet funds stay in your wallet."},{"t":"Lead Categories and the Waitlist","d":"Why you only see Mortgage Protection, and how to join the waitlist.","c":"Leads","u":"articles/lead-categories-and-the-waitlist.html","x":"Mortgage Protection is live. Your current per-lead rate is shown on the Wallet page ($21.63 as of October 2026) and is locked when you add funds. These are coming soon : - Final Expense - General Term - IUL To get on the list, go to https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet and click Join the waitlist next to the category you want."},{"t":"Setting Up Your Thank-You Page Profile and Text Number","d":"Customize what leads see and the text they send you.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/setting-up-your-thank-you-page-and-text-number.html","x":"After a lead submits, they see your thank-you page . Set it up in the Thank-you page profile section at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. 1. Upload photo: add a headshot. 2. License number: enter it and click Save license number . 3. Number your leads text: enter your number, or click Use my account number . Click Send a test text to check it, then Save number . 4. Text message your leads send you: edit the prefilled message (up to 300 characters). You can use these tokens: {lead_first_name} , {rep_first_name} and {state} . 5. Contact card: fill in Display name , Title , Company , Email , Website and Phone , and check the live preview. Reset steps restores the defaults. Changes apply to new leads from then on."},{"t":"Updating Your Contact Info and Timezone","d":"Change your name, phone and timezone.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/updating-contact-info-and-timezone.html","x":"Contact info 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/settings and find Contact info . 2. Update your Full name or Phone . 3. Click Save contact . To change your email , contact support at support@fomoleads.io . Timezone Pick ET , CT , MT , AZ , PT , AKT or HT , then click Save timezone ."},{"t":"Sending Leads to Your CRM by Webhook","d":"Automatically push every new lead into your CRM.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/sending-leads-to-your-crm-by-webhook.html","x":"Fomo Leads can POST every lead to your CRM as JSON the moment it's assigned to you. 1. Get a webhook URL from your CRM Create an automation with an inbound webhook trigger and copy its URL. In GoHighLevel, go to Automations → Create Workflow → Start from Scratch → Add New Trigger → Inbound Webhook . 2. Add it to Fomo Leads 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/integrations and find CRM Webhook . 2. Paste the URL into Webhook URL and click Save . 3. Make sure Automatic delivery is On . 4. Click Send test payload . It's available once the URL is saved, and it sends a test event called lead.test . 3. Map the fields Real leads arrive with the event lead.assigned . The example payload on https://members.fomoleads.io/integrations shows every field. Map those fields to your CRM contact fields, then publish your workflow."},{"t":"GoHighLevel Disposition Sync","d":"Send your pipeline stages and AP from GoHighLevel back to Fomo Leads.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/gohighlevel-disposition-sync.html","x":"Sync your GoHighLevel pipeline stages back to Fomo Leads so your stats stay accurate. In Fomo Leads 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/integrations and find GoHighLevel dispositions . 2. Click Create webhook URL . This makes your private URL. In GoHighLevel 1. Open Automation Workflows and create a workflow. 2. Add the trigger Pipeline stage changed . Also add Opportunity status changed if you want won/lost to sync. 3. Add a Webhook action and set the method to POST . 4. Paste your Fomo Leads URL. 5. Under Custom Data , add stage = {{opportunity.pipeline_stage}} , ap , and optionally fomo_lead_id . 6. Save and publish . Match your stage names Back in Fomo Leads, use Your stage names to map your GoHighLevel stages. Click Add stage name , then Save stage names . Check Recent activity and click Refresh to confirm updates are arriving."},{"t":"Turning On Push Lead Alerts","d":"Get a browser notification when a lead is assigned to you.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/push-lead-alerts.html","x":"Fomo Leads sends a browser push notification whenever a lead is assigned to you. Look for the Lead alerts section at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. 1. Open https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. 2. When your browser asks to show notifications, click Allow . Notifications blocked? Turn them on in your device's Settings › Notifications › Fomo Leads , then reload the page. Note: Lead alerts are push only . There are no email or SMS lead notifications."},{"t":"How Will I Be Notified of New Leads?","d":"Where new leads show up and how you're alerted.","c":"Settings & Integrations","u":"articles/how-will-i-be-notified-of-new-leads.html","x":"- Browser push alerts when a lead is assigned to you (see Turning on push lead alerts ). - Your member area: every lead appears at https://members.fomoleads.io/leads. - Your CRM: connect a webhook at https://members.fomoleads.io/integrations and leads are sent there automatically. Fomo Leads does not send email or SMS lead notifications."},{"t":"Adding Reps and Round-Robin Lead Distribution","d":"Share leads across your team automatically.","c":"Team","u":"articles/adding-reps-and-round-robin.html","x":"\"Reps receive leads via fair-queue rotation and can disposition them.\" 1. Go to https://members.fomoleads.io/team. 2. Click Add rep . \"Add a rep and they'll receive leads via round-robin rotation.\" Each new lead goes to the next rep in line, and reps can update the outcome of their leads."},{"t":"Can I Remove a State?","d":"Yes. Update your states yourself any time.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/can-i-remove-a-state.html","x":"Yes! Go to Coverage states in https://members.fomoleads.io/settings, unselect the state and click Save states . There's nothing to relaunch."},{"t":"I'm Getting Leads in States I'm Not Licensed In","d":"Check your coverage states, and what to do about an out-of-state lead.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/im-getting-leads-in-states-im-not-licensed-in.html","x":"1. Go to Coverage states in https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. Make sure only your licensed states are selected, then click Save states . 2. If a lead still arrives from outside your states, email support@fomoleads.io with the lead's details. Refunds other than quality refunds are reviewed case by case ."},{"t":"How Do I Get More Leads?","d":"Simple ways to increase your lead volume.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/how-do-i-get-more-leads.html","x":"1. Raise your daily leads at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings ( Save daily leads ). 2. Add more licensed states in Coverage states . 3. Keep your wallet funded at https://members.fomoleads.io/wallet. Delivery stops at $0. 4. Move to a bigger plan for a higher ad-spend cap: Launch $3,000, Grow $6,000 or Scale $10,000 per period. 5. Busy days: you may get up to 10 extra verified leads when others in your states are full."},{"t":"How Long Does It Take to Get Leads?","d":"What needs to be in place before leads start.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/how-long-does-it-take-to-get-leads.html","x":"Leads can start once both setup steps on your dashboard are done: - Choose states: \"Required before any new leads can route to you.\" - Add funds: \"Your wallet balance determines how many leads you can receive.\" Once setup is finished, your first lead typically arrives in under 24 hours . After that, lead volume depends on your states and how the campaigns perform."},{"t":"I Got a Text From a Lead, But I Don't See the Lead in My Dashboard","d":"What to do if a lead texts you before showing up in Fomo Leads.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/i-got-a-text-from-a-lead-but-dont-see-it.html","x":"Leads can text the number on your thank-you page right after they submit, so a text can arrive before you see the lead. 1. Refresh https://members.fomoleads.io/leads and check that the date filter is set to All time . 2. If you use a CRM webhook, check your CRM. Leads are sent with the event lead.assigned . 3. If it's still missing, email support@fomoleads.io with the phone number and the time of the text."},{"t":"Does the Thank-You Page Show the Number I'll Be Calling From?","d":"It shows the number you set in Settings.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/does-the-form-show-what-number-ill-be-calling-from.html","x":"The thank-you page shows the Number your leads text that you saved at https://members.fomoleads.io/settings, along with your contact card. Use the number you'll call from so leads recognize you. See Setting up your thank-you page profile and text number ."},{"t":"Are Lead Notifications Instant?","d":"Push alerts go out when a lead is assigned to you.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/are-lead-notifications-instant.html","x":"Yes. Fomo Leads sends a browser push notification when a lead is assigned to you . If alerts don't arrive, enable notifications in your device's Settings › Notifications › Fomo Leads and reload. There are no email or SMS alerts."},{"t":"How Can I Avoid My Phone Number Being Marked as Spam?","d":"Spam labels come from your phone or dialer provider. Here's what helps.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/how-can-i-avoid-my-number-being-marked-as-spam.html","x":"Phone carriers and dialer providers apply spam labels, not Fomo Leads. These help: - Use a registered business number in your dialer or CRM, and rotate numbers if one gets flagged. - Call from the number leads see on your thank-you page. Set it under Number your leads text in https://members.fomoleads.io/settings. - Reach out quickly. Push lead alerts tell you when a lead is assigned to you."},{"t":"How Do I Contact Support?","d":"The way to reach the Fomo Leads team.","c":"FAQs","u":"articles/how-do-i-contact-support.html","x":"Email support@fomoleads.io . There's no in-app chat. Include: - The email on your Fomo Leads account. - What you were trying to do, and any error you saw. - For a lead issue: the lead's name and the date it arrived."}];
